---
output: preproc, svg
---
@startuml
' The escape also holds in the body of a legacy procedure, and in a diagram
' without Python.
' EXPECT (preproc):
' participant A
' note over A
' !important for A
' end note
!procedure $warn($name)
participant $name
note over $name
!!important for $name
end note
!endprocedure
$warn(A)
@enduml
